193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Partial knee replacement is ideal for patients with pain on one side of the knee, strong ligaments, minimal deformity, and good knee movement. Compared to total knee replacement, recovery is usually quicker and easier, with less blood loss and lower risk of blood clots. If arthritis progresses to other parts of the knee it can later be successfully converted into a total knee replacement.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
